	(text "DAC CV ASSIGNMENT (per channel, DAC board MCP4728 U1..U5 = CV0-3 .. CV16-19, LDAC per chip)\nCV0 EQ LF F | CV1 EQ LF G | CV2 EQ HF F | CV3 EQ HF G\nCV4 EQ LMF F | CV5 EQ LMF Q | CV6 EQ LMF G | CV7 INPUT GAIN\nCV8 EQ HMF F | CV9 EQ HMF Q | CV10 EQ HMF G | CV11 COMP GR\nCV12 PAN L | CV13 PAN R | CV14 SEND1 L | CV15 SEND1 R\nCV16 SEND2 L | CV17 SEND2 R | CV18 SEND3 L | CV19 SEND3 R\n!! 21 CVs are needed but the DAC board has 20 per channel: SEND 4 (mono) CV is left unconnected (no-connect flag).\n   Fix: add a 6th MCP4728 per channel on the DAC board, or apply gain reduction through PAN L/R in firmware and free CV11.\n\nSIGNAL ROUTING (per channel)\nINPUT_OUT -> EQ in and FADER AUDIO_PRE_EQ | EQ_OUT -> FADER AUDIO_IN\nFADER INSERT_AUDIO_SEND (pre/post-EQ selected) -> insert send jack, SENDS card input and COMP detector input\nInsert return jack -> FADER INSERT_AUDIO_RTN | FADER MIX outputs -> ADG1412 mute -> shared MIX bus\nSENDS outputs (10k on the card) -> shared AUX1..AUX4 buses | COMP_CV -> 2-pin link header -> fader card top-side J1 (cable)\nCOMP ENV_ADC -> ENV_TO_CONTROLLER header"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 600 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "30753a81-e0c7-4c45-aed8-0244122ad960")
	)
	(text "CHANNEL 3"
